  "published": "2026-11-17T02:31:16.613Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.4.0 adds a net11.0 target, outgoing HttpClient capture (on by default, bodies opt-in via CaptureOutgoingHttpBodies), DebugDump.Dump(value) for snapshotting objects at the call site, and live updates over server-sent events instead of polling (EnableRealTimeUpdates, on by default). RetentionPeriod, CleanupInterval and MaxDatabaseSize are enforced now, the static DebugLogger works, and a request whose handler threw is recorded as 500 instead of 200. Custom IDebugStorage implementations need the new members listed in docs/API.md. Full list in the changelog: https://github.com/eladser/AspNetDebugDashboard/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
